;   27: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=けんらん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   28: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ばくだい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   29: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ぜい, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   30: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=たるはざま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   31: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=とりで, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   32: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=のぞ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   33: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=せんめつ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   34: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=とがわ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=7288, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=6538, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> told me only once.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How he had taken the realm.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\金木犀.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\山1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Long, long ago, </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> wandered alone into a mountain deep in the interior, north of the Eastern Capital.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He was rescued by the people who lived there and was able to return safely, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was then, </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> said, that he received 'the curse of the cherries.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If the head of the Ouda house, Lord </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="おうだ">Enei</STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="えんえい"> Ouda</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, climbed to within a single step of the realm, it was because the King of Demon Warriors was at work behind the scenes―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> told me as much.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As proof of it, the time when </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> judged he would come to rule the realm―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Yes, that was the Riseiji Incident, which broke out in Shiyo 332.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "炎.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\本能寺の変.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed it had been brought about by </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> through </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="あきち">Akichi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-dono, whom he had </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="そそのか">incited</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I see. So that was why Akichi-dono, the Ouda house's second-in-command, rose in </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="むほん">rebellion</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I, too, had thought it strange.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Akichi-dono's rebellion: the timing, the motive, everything about it was as unnatural as could be.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Had he truly received 'the curse of the cherries' and become the King of Demon Warriors?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I was only half convinced of that, but long ago I fell out with </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> and went to war against him.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In the end, partly for political reasons, that time ended in a truce and then a peace settlement, and I never beheld this so-called power of the demon warriors.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That is why I believed </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> had not fought with his full strength.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, that is not all. Here I am, after all, in </STYLE>His Highness's<STYLE ID="1"> service.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If he makes much use of a man who once opposed him, it is because </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> had long recognized me as someone he needed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That must be why he never tried to strike me down.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">I made up my mind at that moment:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1">―I will never defy him.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if a chance at the realm should come my way, I must wait quietly and judge the right time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I will never be hasty, but wait quietly and judge my opportunity.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\大阪城1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Be that as it may, lately </STYLE>His Highness's<STYLE ID="1"> mood had been exceedingly bad.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The bad mood had begun only a few days before.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> was troubled over the question of his successor.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> was still in good health, but his son, the one who mattered, was still young.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">If </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> were to </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="こうきょ">pass away</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what would become of his son in the succession dispute?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">―!!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\太閤殿下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
His Highness<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Why, </STYLE>Your Highness<STYLE ID="9">. I trust you are in good spirits."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> stopped beside me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As I kept my head bowed, I felt his gaze pierce me, unwavering.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">His mood seemed no better today.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="10" RUBY="だいふ">Minister</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Yes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
"I will hold a hanami."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">A hanami?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Indeed, a hanami."<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"You mean the one you have long spoken of, at </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="ごだいじ">Godaiji</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Indeed. But..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> paused for a moment.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Was this to be no ordinary hanami after all?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Some time ago, </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> had been greatly taken with the cherry blossoms he saw at Godaiji in the Western Capital, and a hanami was to be held there on April 20.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The preparation of the tea houses, the hillside and the rest was proceeding steadily.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There were only about 20 days left until the deadline. What more could he want?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hoped he would not make some unreasonable demand...</STYLE><PG>
"There are not enough cherry trees. 
{PAUSE ""}
Therefore, you are to bring cherry trees here."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Not enough cherries...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　But we have already procured as many as 700 trees from the famous growing regions. I would think that is quite enough..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh? You presume to advise me?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"N-no, nothing of the sort..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The cherry trees will be brought from a place I designate. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10" RUBY="だいふ">Minister</STYLE>, you will go there yourself and bring the cherries back from that place."<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">How many would you require...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Let me see. I do not want them exposed to too many eyes while they are moved. 
{PAUSE ""}
Five or so should do."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Just five...?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Cherry trees, brought in from a place he had designated.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What crossed my mind then was </STYLE>His Highness's<STYLE ID="1"> story of 'the curse of the cherries.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Those cherries would be the ones </STYLE>Your Highness<STYLE ID="9"> once told me of, the..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Just what I expect of my <STYLE ID="9">Minister</STYLE>. It will be held on April 20, so have everything ready by then."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">With that, </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> held out a single sheet of paper to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No doubt it showed where those cherries were.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="9">Minister</STYLE>, you understand, do you not?
{PAUSE ""}
　This is the most secret of secrets. 
{PAUSE ""}
You may use laborers to carry the cherries, but once they have served their purpose, those men are―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Yes, I am well aware."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">At that, </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> left humming, as if his mood had suddenly mended.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There were still about 20 days until the deadline. We would just barely make it.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Shiyo 340, April 5―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\荷車.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\山2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">With about 10 men and five carts in tow, I head for a place called Arata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We should arrive by early this afternoon.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">These 10 fellows have no kin, and on top of that they are nothing but outcasts and </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="かぶきもの">swaggering rowdies</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> who will do anything for money.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if they vanish, no one will raise a fuss.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">big important lord</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! So what kind of reward are we getting!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, it's orders from the </STYLE>ruler of the realm<STYLE ID="1">, so it's gotta be money and women, all we want!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Bwahahaha! For me it's booze and meat!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Lord</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! You could at least tell us what we're getting, right!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Decide now what you want. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">As far as possible, you will be given as much as you like."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yahoooo! He says whatever we want, as much as we want!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sure enough, the </STYLE>ruler of the realm<STYLE ID="1"> is something else!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Truly, a coarse lot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Giving them plenty of dreams like this should make them work properly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They are fated to be erased either way. At least I can let them dream good dreams.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There has been a strange smell for a while now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is the smell of burning... a forest fire?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50逆.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "山火事.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Looking closely, I see smoke rising here and there in the distance.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Forest fires cannot break out all at once, scattered like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No doubt about it... it's a battle!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"A horse, bring a horse here!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\馬.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\林走る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "32" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I have the men rest where they are, and ride upwind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What on earth is happening...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A battle, this deep in the mountains, and now, when the realm has already been unified...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> surely still has factions that do not obey him, but I can think of no reason for a battle in a place this remote.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―I have seen many battles in my time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">By now the sight of such </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="さんたん">harrowing</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> scenes is no shock great enough to change my outlook on life.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Foot soldiers in thin armor scatter their </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="ぞうもつ">guts</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and those who wear thick </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="よろい">armor</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> have their heads struck off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All of them have their limbs cut off, and some, not yet dead, go on waiting for death in agony.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Such things are nothing unusual to me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田戦.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">But the scene here goes beyond the </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="はんちゅう">bounds</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> of anything one could call a battle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If human beings did this, I cannot explain how.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "血ノイズ.wmv" "512" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n200\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n200\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">How does one cut a man in half from head to foot?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How does one cut a man in half, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="よろい">armor</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and all?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Corpses like that lie scattered all over this place.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's a battle, no question, but nothing like any battle I know.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Yes―this is not fighting to defeat the enemy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's fighting to kill the enemy, without fail.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The aim isn't to take the general's head.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The aim is to kill the enemy one second sooner.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This... this isn't a battle... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it's just a massacre...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\片足足音.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At that moment, behind me, the clinking sound of someone walking.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Wha...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It is a warrior of a grotesque form, such as I have never seen before.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\片足.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "200" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Both his arms and one leg have been cut off, and blood pours ceaselessly from the wounds.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Yet his face shows no </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="くもん">anguish</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He is hobbling along on his one leg as if he felt no pain at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Youuu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... who are you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>The man calls out to me as if he cannot even grasp his own condition.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What is the matter with this man! He is in no position to be concerned with me...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\手で歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then, from another direction this time, the slapping sound of someone walking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No... for someone walking, the sound is somehow wrong.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It could be bare feet, but even so, the sound is somehow heavy, or rather...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">............!!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I thought even the man missing both arms and a leg was grotesque.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But the other one who has appeared </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="りょうが">surpasses</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> even him: truly a form neither apparition nor yokai.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="19"><TXSPS>"Ah, found you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="19">Found you...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>That man shouts at the man missing both arms and a leg.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Where on earth does this man have that kind of strength left...!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">After all, this man... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\上半身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "200" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">He has no lower body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Using his hands in place of feet, he slaps his way forward.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="19"><TXSPS>"I'll kill you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="19">I'll kill you...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="19">"Die!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="19">　Die!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>They glare at each other, murderous intent </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="む">bared</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> on both sides―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "20" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The half-man leaps eight shaku on the strength of his hands alone, and the one-legged man somersaults forward through the air like a wheel and tries to unleash a </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="しゅうげき">kick</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The one-legged man's leg cuts through the air like a sickle-wind as it comes down on the half-man.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But the next instant―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田戦.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">With a loud crash, the one-legged man is slammed into the ground.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From the impact, the one-legged man's upper body has been crushed flat, as flat as a cockroach.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And the half-man </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\上半身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">lands softly on both hands.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The movements are so far beyond anything human that I cannot even comprehend what is happening.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">But with the jolt of the half-man's landing, some organ slithers out of his body.</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A thing hanging from his body, attached by huge blood vessels―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\心臓の鼓動.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\エデン\心臓.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">It throbs, pulsing, and the severed ends of the huge vessels gape open and shut like a fish cast up on the shore.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That is unmistakably the heart.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then the half-man turns toward me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\上半身心臓.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "300" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">samurai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Don't go laying hands on Droga... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You'll end up like me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9"><TXSPN>"Droga?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">His face still expressionless, the half-man raises his voice to warn me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What is Droga?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Does he mean that laying hands on Droga turns you into something like this?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Has the half-man finally used up his strength?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He falls flat where he is, and now he only </STYLE><STYLE ID="22" RUBY="けいれん">convulses</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, twitching.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田戦.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">What is this... what is this place...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> indicated this very place, beyond doubt: the Arata settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Is this Arata settlement a place where yokai live?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And I am to bring back the cherries of a place where yokai live...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With those two grotesque figures before me I failed to notice, but cherry trees are in full bloom all around, their blossoms scattering like sprays of blood.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The sight of those cherries brings me back to myself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My mission this time is to dig up the cherries here and take them to the capital.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But what will the men think when they see this scene?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">No, do not worry about that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Once they finish carrying the cherries, they are fated to be dealt with.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Whatever they learn now, it makes no difference.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Until they are given their reward, they will not leave my side.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\穴掘り.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I summon the men, and we set to work digging up the cherries.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Two men to a tree, we dig them up, and we leave this land before the sun goes down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I want to leave this frightening place even a moment sooner.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The men, too, are bewildered by the sight, but―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "山火事.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Heeeave-ho, the realm's cherries, let's diiig them uuup!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mooney! Woomen! Boooze! Meeeat"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They hum things like that as they dig up the cherries one after another.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is what makes ruffians easy to handle.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The people of Arata, having noticed us, watch our work </STYLE><STYLE ID="23" RUBY="ぼうぜん">blankly</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Every one of them is covered in blood, and none seems to have the will left to stop our work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Or do they see no value at all in these cherries?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Or perhaps they think five cherry trees nothing but a </STYLE><STYLE ID="24" RUBY="ささい">trifling</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> matter.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山夕日.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">By the time the sun begins to touch the ridgeline, the five cherry trees are loaded onto the carts and we are ready to set out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"All of you, well done! We now set out for the Western Capital!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Once all the cherries have been delivered, I promise each of you will receive ample reward from </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="9">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At that, a cheer goes up from the men.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\荷車.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\星空.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The men are in high spirits.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They have the cherries they came for, and a great reward from </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> awaits them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Naturally, with a reward from the ruler of the realm in store, their hopes swell.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Never knowing they will soon be disposed of.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The words that half-man left behind weigh on my mind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The word Droga, so plainly Western.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1">―should I ask him?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No. If it is a word that must not be known, I could even be cut down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I have no choice but to keep pretending I know nothing.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Shiyo 340, April 11―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\醍醐寺五重塔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-1138\r\n10000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "10000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-1138\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">A day ahead of the promised April 12, we arrived at </STYLE><STYLE ID="25" RUBY="ごだいじ">Godaiji</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> in the Western Capital.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That we arrived early was probably thanks to the men's greed to get their reward even a little sooner.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE>Your Highness<STYLE ID="9">, I have brought what you commanded."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\太閤殿下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Hmm, well done. 
{PAUSE ""}
Once you have disposed of those men, <STYLE ID="9">you</STYLE> may rest as well."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Yes, I am most honored."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> appeared to be in very fine spirits.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Now then, all of you! You have served well in this task!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Over there, sake, tea and sweets have been laid out for you!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Your rewards will be prepared now, so wait there a while!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hearing that, the men let out a great cheer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All of it had been laced with poison and a sleeping drug.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="26" RUBY="ちこうせい">It was a slow-acting</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> poison, so they would die in their sleep without suffering.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was the least consideration I could show them for working so hard to get this far.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Long ago, Lord </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="おうだ">Enei</STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="えんえい"> Ouda</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> used to say:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To rule the realm, sacrifice is always necessary.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Let 10 die now, or 100,000 die in the future: which do you choose?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Be ruthless for the sake of the future, or throw the future away for what is before your eyes―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―For the hanami of April 20, the planting went steadily ahead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\炎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The 10 men who had been dealt with were all burned and used as fertilizer for the cherries.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Everyone else was told that they had caught an epidemic while transporting the cherries and died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So everyone, eager not to spread the infection, was quick to burn the bodies.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "3000"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">And then, April 20―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\流るる時.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "222" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\醍醐の花見絵画.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\醍醐寺桜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
{DELETECG "222" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-886\r\n100000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">About 1,300 guests from all over the land, down to the wives of the daimyo and the ladies-in-waiting.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They took part in this event of a lifetime.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was a truly magnificent hanami, so grand that it overturned every notion of what a hanami could be, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="27" RUBY="けんらん">lavish</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and splendid.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Truly an event that seemed to embody everything glamorous and showy about </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">There were tea ceremonies and poetry gatherings, and the women who attended were ordered to change their clothes twice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The costumes alone cost an </STYLE><STYLE ID="28" RUBY="ばくだい">enormous</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sum (3.9 billion yen in today's money).</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Truly an event on which the ruler of the realm spared no </STYLE><STYLE ID="29" RUBY="ぜい">extravagance</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was more than enough to display the authority of the ruler of the realm and make everyone swear still greater loyalty.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But I, the Minister, know.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The true aim of this hanami―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it is no more than a disguise, so that the cherries taken from Arata can be kept near </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If the cherries were simply brought in, some would find it suspicious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That is why a pretext was needed: gathering beautiful cherries even from outside the famous growing regions, 'for the hanami.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">That half-man of Arata told me:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">'Never lay a hand on Droga.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I have pieced together the general shape of things.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The word 'Droga' apparently means 'drug' or 'narcotic' in the West.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, because the people of Arata laid hands on Droga, they started a battle like that and sank into forms one could only call yokai.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And in spite of those terrible wounds, movements one could hardly believe were human.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-886\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I have a faint memory of seeing it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\雷雨.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "雨1.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\桶狭間雨.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">That battle at </STYLE><STYLE ID="30" RUBY="たるはざま">Taruhazama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, in which Ouda destroyed Magawa.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At the time I was on Magawa's side, attacking another </STYLE><STYLE ID="31" RUBY="とりで">fort</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just as the outcome was about to be decided, I took a </STYLE><STYLE ID="32" RUBY="のぞ">look</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> at Taruhazama, and―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">There was a horde of demon warriors there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Moving in ways no human could, they scattered the Magawa troops and overturned an overwhelming disadvantage.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I see. So at that time </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> used a drug called Droga on his soldiers.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And that drug is made from the cherries of Arata.</STYLE><PG>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> surely means to hand Droga down to his son should the succession question come to a head.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then it would even be possible to </STYLE><STYLE ID="33" RUBY="せんめつ">wipe out</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> the opposing factions by force.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That is why he keeps the Arata cherries close by.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">At this moment, I understand how much of an illusion </STYLE>His Highness's<STYLE ID="1"> unification of the realm has been.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I know it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Soon, the age of the </STYLE>Fuji<STYLE ID="1"> will end.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Droga exists only in that land of Arata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Could such a thing ever be made here in the west, so far away?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This plan will surely―end in failure.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―5 months after the hanami.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> breathed his last.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He had taken to his sickbed soon after the hanami.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, to be precise, the illness had apparently been eating at him since before the hanami.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But his son was young, and with so short a lineage, the </STYLE>Fuji<STYLE ID="1"> house would not prosper for long.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That was why absolute power was needed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Power so strong that no one could defy it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> had tried to create Droga from the Arata cherries, but...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\蝉。夕空。.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In less than a month, all five of the Arata cherries had withered.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Not one remained. All at once, every one of them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I saw the withered trees myself, and they did not look like trees at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When a tree withers, only its leaves and flowers fall, and the trunk and branches remain as they were.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But with the Arata cherries, the whole tree had shrunk in on itself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just like a dried-up mushroom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On seeing that sight, </STYLE>His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> fell into a frenzy, and from then on shut himself away in his bedchamber.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">He must have been sure the matter of his heir would be settled, but it had turned, quite thoroughly, into an illusion.</STYLE><PG>
His Highness<STYLE ID="1"> is dead now, and I have no more use for the weakened </STYLE>Fuji<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From now on, we </STYLE><STYLE ID="34" RUBY="とがわ">Togawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will rule the realm.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">We will not rely on the likes of drugs. With firm government and a sound economy, we will bring this land to peace.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From now on, I will never have anything to do with Arata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Demons live in that land.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And demon flowers grow thick there, exactly like cherry trees.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">What was it, that Arata cherry so exactly like the cherry tree?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I cannot deny that such curiosity exists in me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I must pass this on to later generations.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Droga―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">never lay a hand on it.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
